[h1]Known Incompatible[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Work Tab Mods:[/b] Better Work Tab, Enhanced Work Tab, Work Tab and its forks, [FSF] Complex Jobs.
[*][b]Priority-Setting Mods:[/b] Force Do Job, Free Will, PriorityMaster, Personal Work Categories, and anything else that uses SetPriority.
[/list]

